{"id": "FRK-02", "kind": "math", "statement_nl": "W_N squared equals -N times the identity matrix; since scalars act trivially on H, W_N is an involution of the upper half-plane.", "lean_name": "SocrateAI.ModularForms.frickeW_sq_coe", "lean_file": "Lean/SocrateAI/ModularForms/FrickeInvolution.lean", "status": "proved", "depends_on": ["FRK-DEF"], "paper_claim": "GL2-WN-02"}
